Greetings,

Almost two weeks have passed since the release of The Wild Lands, and today we wanted to share some incredible numbers with you.
[list]
    [*]Since the release of The Wild Lands, we had lots of new players - roughly 20% more players have enjoyed their adventures in Alandia since June 22th;
[*]During the work on The Wild Lands, we reworked over 15% of the original game's code and brought back from beta builds one important gameplay feature;
    [*]Over 6% of our past players returned to the world of Alandia after the release of The Wild Lands;
    [*]We have processed 100% of user reports sent to our email and fixed 100% of bugs reported to us that way during the time that passed since the launch of the game;
[*]Game's optimization improved by up to 20-30% on some levels - that's counting the fact that some levels became almost twice bigger;
[*]Only 1.5% of players were able to get 100% of achievements, while over 6% already have at least one of them unlocked.
[/list]
We always tried to base our decisions on what is best for our whole community - not only the vocal minority - and we are really proud of our successes together by far.

There are players who played the game together with their children - sometimes even with their whole families - across the world. Of course we had multiple cases when reviewers and streamers who tried to resell their streamers key - so big thanks to everyone who are actually streaming the game and taking their time to make a video about it - that matters a lot for us!

Thank you for staying with us throughout this journey, and thanks again for playing!
